      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The reservation spans more than 25,000 square miles and stretches across New Mexico, Utah, Colorado, and Arizona.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
